docs {
  ## API explanation
  Edits a unit. Admin or Manager. Turning `allows_fraction` off is rejected
  while any stock, minimum quantity or requisition in this unit has decimals.
  Audited.


  ## API example response
  {
    "id": 8,
    "name": "Packets",
    "symbol": "pack",
    "allows_fraction": false,
    "component_count": 0,
    "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.335097+06:00",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.340707+06:00"
  }
}

settings {
